# Everything committed is under src/ (the whole build input), tests/, and the entry points at
# the root. Everything below is either generated or a local working store, and a fresh clone
# must build without any of it: `./setup.sh && ./build.sh`.

# --- generated ----------------------------------------------------------------
# build/target (Cargo, via .cargo/config.toml), build/web (Vite) and build/www (the deployable
# site make_page.py writes). Delete the directory and the next build recreates all of it.
/build

# npm packages have to sit next to the package.json that declares them, so they cannot live
# under build/. ./setup.sh installs them.
/src/web/node_modules

# Renders and captures the browser harness writes. Cargo requires integration tests to sit in
# tests/ next to Cargo.toml, so the harness cannot move under build/ with its output.
/tests/output

# --- local working stores, deliberately not part of the repository -------------
# The agent knowledge base and ticket tracker (see AGENTS.md), their tooling, and several
# hundred megabytes of third-party reference material: the LuxCore checkout we port from,
# Gem Cut Studio captures and sample faceting designs.
#
# Nothing the build reads is in here. `cargo test` skips the three camera tests that measure a
# Gem Cut Studio screenshot when reference/ is absent (tests/gcs_camera_outline.rs), and the
# Deno suites under src/js/tests and src/web/tests skip the 66 cases that read the sample
# designs in reference/ -- so every suite is green on a clone that has none of it.
/kb
/tickets
/tools
/reference
/target
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md

# --- noise --------------------------------------------------------------------
/.claude
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc
/.cargo